    ],
    "https://prez.dev/description": [
      {
        "@value": "A level to gently undulating landform pattern of extremely low relief on which stream channels are very rare. The pattern consists of relict, parallel linear ridges built by waves, separated by, and built over, flats aggraded by tides or over-bank stream flow.",
